                      {
                        "id": "p25-q1d-short-reason",
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "fontSize": null,
                        "align": "left",
                        "spaceBefore": 0,
                        "spaceAfter": 2,
                        "lineHeight": 1.4,
                        "indent": 0,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Add the diagonal segments, the bottom horizontal segment and the two free ends.",
                            "marks": []
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "worked": "There are $2(n-1)$ diagonal segments, each of length $\\sqrt{d^2+g^2}$, one bottom horizontal segment of length $g$, and two free ends of length $\\ell$ each.\n$$\\begin{align*}L&=2(n-1)\\times\\sqrt{d^2+g^2}+g+\\ell+\\ell\\\\L&=2(n-1)\\sqrt{d^2+g^2}+g+2\\ell\\end{align*}$$",
